#==============================================================================================
#
#   parsed_font_face - CSS::ParsedFontFace: an @font-face rule's descriptors as values the
#                      font computer uses
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/ParsedFontFace.cpp (lines 1-241) and the inline members of
#       ParsedFontFace.h (lines 19-64): the sources of a src descriptor, the family, weight
#       range, slope, width, unicode ranges, metric overrides, font-display, named instance,
#       language override and feature and variation settings of a CSSFontFaceDescriptors.
